# Grandfathered cross-package references: `@compile {:no_warn_undefined, Mod}`
# sites where Mod lives in a tree the package's mix.exs does not declare.
# One `file<TAB>module<TAB>owning tree` per line; `undefined` means no
# defmodule in the repo matches. Checked by scripts/check-package-boundaries.sh.
#
# This list only shrinks. Entries are not a licence to call the module: each
# one raises UndefinedFunctionError when the package runs without that tree.
# Remove an entry when the site is fixed (module moved into the owning
# package, implementation injected via application config, or call deleted).
